    "description": "The Extend Parking Reservations API allows users to modify existing parking reservation times for greater convenience. This endpoint facilitates the extension of reservation durations, ensuring that users can secure their parking for longer periods as needed. It is particularly useful for customers who require additional time at their parking spot, such as during events or meetings. Typical consumers of this API include parking service providers and mobile applications that manage parking reservations. By utilizing this service, users enhance their overall parking experience and avoid the hassle of rebooking.",
